# <type>(<scope>)!: <subject>
#
# type:    feat | fix | docs | test | refactor | style | build | ci | chore
# scope:   optional, e.g. client, options, di, tests, smoke
# !:       only for a breaking change, with a BREAKING CHANGE: footer below
# subject: imperative, lowercase, no trailing period, header at most 72 characters
#
# Body (optional): what changed and why, wrapped at 72 characters.
#
# Footers (optional): BREAKING CHANGE: <what breaks and how to migrate>
#                     Fixes #<issue>
#
# The full convention is in CONTRIBUTING.md.
